        "response": "The total new contract value for **Meridian Analytics** from won deals in `sales_q3.csv` is **$1,040,000.00**, across **14 won deals** in Q3.\n\nHere's the breakdown:\n\n| Deal ID | Rep | Region | Product | Amount | Close Date |\n|---------|-----|--------|---------|--------|------------|\n| D001 | James Okafor | North | Meridian Insights Pro | $87,500 | 2026-07-05 |\n| D002 | Sofia Delgado | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $62,000 | 2026-07-08 |\n| D003 | James Okafor | East | Meridian DataBridge | $43,000 | 2026-07-12 |\n| D005 | Sofia Delgado | North | Meridian DataBridge | $55,000 | 2026-07-19 |\n| D006 | James Okafor | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $120,000 | 2026-07-22 |\n| D008 | Sofia Delgado | West | Meridian DataBridge | $38,000 | 2026-08-02 |\n| D009 | James Okafor | North | Meridian Insights Pro | $95,000 | 2026-08-05 |\n| D010 | Sofia Delgado | East | Meridian Insights Pro | $74,000 | 2026-08-09 |\n| D012 | James Okafor | West | Meridian DataBridge | $66,000 | 2026-08-14 |\n| D014 | Marcus Webb | East | Meridian Insights Lite | $8,500 | 2026-08-21 |\n| D015 | James Okafor | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $88,000 | 2026-08-25 |\n| D017 | James Okafor | North | Meridian DataBridge | $72,000 | 2026-09-02 |\n| D019 | Sofia Delgado | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $198,000 | 2026-09-05 |\n| D021 | Sofia Delgado | North | Meridian DataBridge | $33,000 | 2026-09-07 |\n\n**Note:** 8 additional deals in the file were excluded \u2014 3 had status \"lost\" and 5 had status \"pending.\" Only the 14 deals with status \"won\" are included in the $1,040,000 total. You're good to use this figure for the Q3 report update.",
